# The funded mobile-turret arm. v1 proved a 4,500 composition entry hijacks
# the derived reserve (income 0/s, defeated); v2 pinned the reserve and the
# economy breathed -- best rival dip yet, 3,900 -- but ordinary production
# still never accumulated 4,500 (asked 1178, got 0), so no turret was ever
# fielded. v3 funds them through the saving-hire channel the medics and the
# tech unlock already use: a refused hire withholds its price, one on order
# at a time, bounded by this headcount ([[policy-budget]],
# [[community-play-strategies]]).

